Alpamayo 2 Edge FP8 (weight-only)
=================================

This repository contains a derivative of NVIDIA Alpamayo 2 Edge.

Upstream model
--------------
  Name     : NVIDIA Alpamayo 2 Edge
  Source   : https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Alpamayo2-Edge
  Code     : https://github.com/NVlabs/alpamayo2-edge
  Developed by NVIDIA Corporation as part of the Alpamayo Open Platform
