The upstream tokenizer, processor and configuration assets are redistributed
unchanged and remain NVIDIA's, under the same OpenMDW-1.1 terms.

New material in this repository
-------------------------------
The FP8 quantization scheme, the quantized weights produced by it, and the
following source files are new work and are provided under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see the SPDX headers):

    fp8_quant.py       FP8 (e4m3) weight-only modules and the swap routine
    load_fp8.py        loader for the quantized checkpoint
    quantize_fp8.py    reproducible quantizer (BF16 release -> this checkpoint)
    example.py         minimal inference example

Upstream source code (NVlabs/alpamayo2-edge) remains under Apache License 2.0.
